          "path": "/home/katherine/dac/benchmarks/dacomp-de/dacomp-de-impl-005/docs/data_contract.yaml",
          "line": 783,
          "original_text": "      business_logic: '- Load all rows from staging.stg_google_ads__keyword_stats (ks). - Join dimensional data: - Join to staging.stg_google_ads__ad_group_history (agi) filtered to is_most_recent_record = true on ad_group_id and source_relation. - Join to staging.stg_google_ads__campaign_history (ci) filtered to is_most_recent_record = true on campaign_id and source_relation. - Compute per-row performance metrics (rounding to 4 decimals unless noted; NULL policies explicit): - ctr: if impressions > 0 → (clicks / impressions) * 100; else 0; rounded 4 decimals; unit = percentage (0+). - cpc: if clicks > 0 → spend / clicks; else 0; rounded 4 decimals. - cpm: if impressions > 0 → spend / impressions * 1000; else 0; rounded 4 decimals. - cost_per_conversion: if conversions > 0 → spend / conversions; else NULL; rounded 4 decimals. - roas: if spend > 0 and conversions_value > 0 → conversions_value / spend; else 0; rounded 4 decimals. - conversion_rate: if clicks > 0 → (conversions / clicks) * 100; else 0; rounded 4 decimals; unit = percentage (0+). - Compute lifetime cumulative metrics using window sums partitioned by (keyword_id = ks.criterion_id, ad_group_id) ordered by date_day, rows unbounded preceding: - lifetime_spend, lifetime_clicks, lifetime_conversions, lifetime_conversions_value. - Compute days_since_first_activity: number of days between the first date in the (keyword_id, ad_group_id) partition and the current date_day; non-negative integer. - Compute campaign-level benchmarks over (partition by campaign_id, date_day): - campaign_avg_ctr, campaign_avg_cpc, campaign_avg_conversion_rate, campaign_avg_roas (simple averages of per-row metrics). - Percentile ranks: ctr_percentile_in_campaign = percent_rank ordered by ctr ascending; conv_rate_percentile_in_campaign = percent_rank ordered by conversion_rate ascending; roas_percentile_in_campaign = percent_rank ordered by roas descending; range [0,1]. - Derive segmentation and recommendations: - ctr_vs_campaign_pct: if campaign_avg_ctr > 0 → ((ctr - campaign_avg_ctr) / campaign_avg_ctr) * 100; else NULL; rounded 2 decimals. - roas_vs_campaign_pct: if campaign_avg_roas > 0 → ((roas - campaign_avg_roas) / campaign_avg_roas) * 100; else NULL; rounded 2 decimals. - keyword_maturity_stage by days_since_first_activity: <7 → \"New Keyword\"; <30 → \"Testing Phase\"; <90 → \"Optimization Phase\"; <365 → \"Mature Keyword\"; else \"Legacy Keyword\". - performance_tier based on percentiles (evaluated in listed order; first match wins): ctr_pct >= 0.8 and conv_pct >= 0.8 → \"Star Performer\"; ctr_pct >= 0.6 and conv_pct >= 0.6 → \"Strong Performer\"; ctr_pct >= 0.4 and conv_pct >= 0.4 → \"Average Performer\"; ctr_pct >= 0.2 or conv_pct >= 0.2 → \"Weak Performer\"; else \"Poor Performer\". - bid_recommendation: roas > campaign_avg_roas*1.5 and ctr > campaign_avg_ctr*1.2 → \"Increase Bid (+20%)\"; roas > campaign_avg_roas*1.2 and ctr > campaign_avg_ctr → \"Increase Bid (+10%)\"; roas < campaign_avg_roas*0.7 and ctr < campaign_avg_ctr*0.8 → \"Decrease Bid (-20%)\"; roas < campaign_avg_roas*0.8 and ctr < campaign_avg_ctr → \"Decrease Bid (-10%)\"; conversions = 0 and days_since_first_activity > 30 → \"Consider Pausing\"; else \"Maintain Bid\". - efficiency_score: treat any missing percentile as 0, weight (ctr 30, conv_rate 40, roas 30), clamp to [0,100]; final output rounded to 1 decimal. - volume_tier by lifetime_spend: <100 → \"Low Volume\"; <1000 → \"Medium Volume\"; <5000 → \"High Volume\"; else \"Premium Volume\". - value_tier by lifetime_conversions_value: <500 → \"Low Value\"; <2500 → \"Medium Value\"; <10000 → \"High Value\"; else \"Premium Value\". - Derive quality/ops flags (always non-NULL booleans): - data_quality_flag: clicks > impressions. - optimization_needed_flag: spend > 100 and conversions = 0 and days_since_first_activity > 14. - scale_opportunity_flag: roas > 5 and ctr > campaign_avg_ctr * 1.5. - pause_candidate_flag: efficiency_score < 20 and days_since_first_activity > 30. - Final filter (rows must satisfy): spend >= 0, clicks >= 0, impressions >= 0, conversions >= 0, and date_day, keyword_id, ad_group_id, campaign_id are NOT NULL. - Output rows are ordered by keyword_id, ad_group_id, date_day; no de-duplication beyond the final filter.'\n",
          "association": "同一原文行同时提及列名和 precision/rounding/format/type-conversion 关键词；未判定语句适用范围"
        },
